."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Persica's eyes narrow as her body quivers in murderous fury."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you can't make anything without an existing framework, that's alright. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But what we need is a machine that can create unique and customized chocolate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's a very shoddy attempt to goad me into action."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Persica says with reined in anger. She may sound calm, but everyone can tell she is still seething."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You'd better be prepared for the consequences."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I am always prepared."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_door_elecport","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With that, she stalks out of her room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Watching her receding figure, Kalina and the Commander stare at each other incredulously."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It worked a second time..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Hello","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...To be honest, I'm just as surprised. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's hard to fathom how competitive humans can get."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Commander, is this really a good idea?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... I'm not sure, but the damage is done. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At the very least, our most urgent problem has been solved."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander rubs their throbbing forehead and gets up helplessly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As for what comes next... We'll leave that for later."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Starting from next year, maybe you should let me help you with the preparations for White Day. What do you say?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're also one of the recipients. That would completely ruin the surprise for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're oddly persistent about some very odd things..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After all, I know how much this means to—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M1 Garand","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AAAAAAAAHHHH!!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[]